              "Examples\n",
              "--------\n",
              "Constructing DataFrame from a dictionary.\n",
              "\n",
              "&gt;&gt;&gt; d = {&#x27;col1&#x27;: [1, 2], &#x27;col2&#x27;: [3, 4]}\n",
